<section class="section" aria-labelledby="map-note-heading">
  <div class="notice-panel">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Where the lines come from</p>
      <h2 id="map-note-heading">Forest Department files, joined and measured, with the gaps shown</h2>
      <p>
        Every reserve and zone line on these maps is taken from a Rajasthan Forest Department map file listed
        below, not from OpenStreetMap. The Department's register says these files are for management use, are
        not final and are not for legal purposes; the legal boundary is the notification schedules. About
        {{ stats.not_mapped_notified_km2 | round }} sq km of the 1,135.787 sq km notified in 2023 has no public map
        file at all, so no outline here, or anywhere public, shows the whole reserve.
      </p>
